<title>USA: Loctite rejects Henkel offer.</title>
<headline>Loctite rejects Henkel offer.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loctite Corp said on Monday that a special committee of its board of directors has determined that the tender offer from Germany's Henkel KGaA is inadequate and will recommend shareholders reject the bid.</p>
</text>
